; rune2: rune rebuilt over nx2, beside packages/rune until it replaces it.
; Its stanzas name no flag of their own: in dune language 3.21 the dev
; profile compiles with the compiler's default warnings, which leave unused
; values, opens and fields unreported, so keep dune's stricter set.

(env
 (dev
  (flags
   (:standard %{dune-warnings}))
  (env-vars
   (WINDTRAP_TIMEOUT 60)))
 (_
  (env-vars
   (WINDTRAP_TIMEOUT 60))))
